            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The Satisfyer Mighty One is an app-controlled vibrating ring designed to bring powerful, interactive stimulation into intimate play. Its long, graduated conical shape is engineered to deliver intense clitoral stimulation with every movement, while also offering added versatility for anal play, making it suitable for adventurous solo or partnered experiences.<br/><br/>When paired with the Satisfyer Connect app, the Mighty One unlocks a new level of control and creativity. Users can explore dynamic vibration experiences that respond to sound, motion, playlists, or remote input—turning pleasure into a fully customizable and connected experience.{{ block.settings.page.title }}</p>{{ block.settings.page.content }}",
            "page": ""
          }
