        "collapsible_tab_PQya4J": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/product-info-icon_a8db015b-ddf4-4acd-97f6-bcb1fc623814.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>The Mighty One is equipped with Bluetooth connectivity and works seamlessly with the free Satisfyer Connect app for Android, iOS, and Apple Watch. The app allows access to advanced features such as custom vibration design, ambient sound vibration, playlist-based vibration, and remote control, all while meeting strict German data protection standards with no registration required.<br/><br/>The vibrating head is made from silky-soft medical silicone, which absorbs body heat quickly and feels smooth against the skin. The toy is waterproof, rechargeable via a magnetic USB charging cable, and designed for easy cleaning with warm water and mild soap.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_tab_CDVNV9": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Why you'll love it",
            "accordion_image": "shopify://shop_images/why-youll-love-it-icon_cfeb8990-ada5-4667-b824-aee5a0ca42cc.png",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p>One of the standout advantages of the Mighty One is its deep integration with the award-winning Satisfyer Connect app, which has received the CES TWICE Picks Award for innovation in haptic programming, motion detection, and vibration creation. This allows users to design, save, and even share vibration patterns globally.<br/><br/>With a focus on privacy, sustainability, and performance, the Mighty One combines powerful motors, premium materials, and intelligent technology in a discreet, versatile design. Backed by Satisfyer’s reputation for innovation and quality, it is a bold choice for users who want full control, interactivity, and next-level stimulation.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
